SUMMARY:Sonic Christmas Parade
LOCATION:Downtown to the Oil Center\, Downtown to the Oil Center\, Lafayett
 e
DESCRIPTION:The annual parade marks the official arrival of Santa in Lafaye
 tte. Santa is the star of the parade which will also have floats\, high sc
 hool marching bands and dance clubs. Kids should bring any letters for San
 ta to the parade where they will be collected and mailed to the North Pole
 . The Sonic Christmas Parade is a perfect opportunity to get into the holi
 day spirit. The parade begins at 1:00 PM at the Jefferson Street underpass
  in Downtown. The parade will travel down Jefferson Street toward Johnston
  on its way toward the Oil Center. After the parade passes through Downtow
 n\, there will be an after-party held at Parc International with a chance 
 to take pictures with Santa and enjoy the North Pole installation at the p
 arc. For parade details call (337) 501-2600.\n\nhttps://www.lafayettetrave
 l.com/event/sonic-christmas-parade/27992/
